        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n3\n5",
        "output": "8 1 6\n3 5 7\n4 9 2\n1 2 3 4 5\n6 8 7 10 12\n9 11 13 15 17\n14 16 19 18 20\n21 22 23 24 25",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: All elements of the matrix are distinct and the sum of every row and column is equal to 151515. Thus, all conditions are satisfied."
